00:17:09.970 --> 00:17:11.630
ketchup on your shirt or something.

381
00:17:11.870 --> 00:17:13.310
So yeah, they always had multiples.

382
00:17:13.810 --> 00:17:22.170
And part of the wardrobe department's job is to launder and prepare your outfit for the

383
00:17:22.170 --> 00:17:22.770
next day.

384
00:17:22.870 --> 00:17:24.250
So that's how that works.

